  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/6D3271">Corollary <span data-tag="6D3271">7.1.4.4</span>.</a> Under the hypotheses of Theorem <a href="/tag/CEEDB2" data-tag="CEEDB2">7.1.4.3</a>, the functor $\Sing _{X}$ induces an equivalence of $\infty $-categories </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \sNerve ( \Top _{/X}^{\circ } ) \rightarrow \Shv (X). \]
</div>
  <p> In particular, the $\infty $-category $\sNerve ( \Top _{/X}^{\circ } )$ is an $\infty $-topos. </p>
